# Build Automation & SweetPad Integration

**CRITICAL:** This file defines how the LLM should use build automation tools (SweetPad/xcodebuild) to verify code changes automatically in agent mode.

## Purpose

When in agent mode, the LLM must automatically verify builds and tests after code changes. This ensures:
- Zero-warning policy enforcement
- Test verification before marking work complete
- Immediate error detection and fixing
- No manual build verification required

---

## SweetPad Build Commands

### Physical Device Build Command

**Current Configuration:**
- **Device ID:** `00008110-0006758C2683801E` (physical iOS device)
- **Workspace:** `/Users/cdelgado/Documents/github.com/HarmoniAudio/HarmoniAudio.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace`
- **Scheme:** `HarmoniAudio`
- **Configuration:** `Debug`

**Build Command:**
```bash
xcodebuild \
  -scheme HarmoniAudio \
  -configuration Debug \
  -workspace /Users/cdelgado/Documents/github.com/HarmoniAudio/HarmoniAudio.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace \
  -destination 'platform=iOS,id=00008110-0006758C2683801E' \
  -resultBundlePath '/Users/cdelgado/Library/Application Support/Cursor/User/workspaceStorage/64515c314cd23c8f4b0eabadd2006e0c/sweetpad.sweetpad/bundle/HarmoniAudio' \
  -allowProvisioningUpdates \
  build
```

**Test Command:**
```bash
xcodebuild \
  -scheme HarmoniAudio \
  -configuration Debug \
  -workspace /Users/cdelgado/Documents/github.com/HarmoniAudio/HarmoniAudio.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace \
  -destination 'platform=iOS,id=00008110-0006758C2683801E' \
  -resultBundlePath '/Users/cdelgado/Library/Application Support/Cursor/User/workspaceStorage/64515c314cd23c8f4b0eabadd2006e0c/sweetpad.sweetpad/bundle/HarmoniAudio' \
  -allowProvisioningUpdates \
